Mediawiki, the engine that Wikipedia runs on has an annoying bug.
If the bug was fixed it would be possible while clicking on a selected
image (e.g. the image of a French flag) immediately change to French
interface of the wiki.

Of course, for other languages as well.
As we are a language community please register on bugzilla and upvote the
bug on the following page:

https://bugzilla.wikimedia.org/page.cgi?id=voting/user.html&bug_id=47646#vote_47646

P.S. If you can fix this bug yourself please do :) and here is the
description of the bug itself.
https://bugzilla.wikimedia.org/show_bug.cgi?id=47646

